":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15604","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120209","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42282","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94904","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"371437","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"52654","synopsis":"Catarina is kidnapped by someone while on her way to the ball, but after awakening in an unfamiliar room, she struggles to fully grasp her situation and doesn't seem to realize she's been kidnapped. Even when the kidnapper shows up to see her in person and she asks why she was kidnapped, her questions are easily dodged. Meanwhile, Geordo receives a letter from the kidnapper and immediately begins an investigation to find and rescue Catarina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/guoTZ8mnVEggFOcPsrqo7HrEoF.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Catarina is kidnapped by someone while on her way to the ball, but after awakening in an unfamiliar room, she struggles to fully grasp her situation and doesn't seem to realize she's been kidnapped. Even when the kidnapper shows up to see her in person and she asks why she was kidnapped, her questions are easily dodged. Meanwhile, Geordo receives a letter from the kidnapper and immediately begins an investigation to find and rescue Catarina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/guoTZ8mnVEggFOcPsrqo7HrEoF.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15604","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120209","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42282","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94904","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"371437","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"52730","synopsis":"The one behind the kidnapping of Catarina Claes turns out to be someone that nobody expected. Catarina is shocked to learn the true reason why he kidnapped her, but he's so moved by her cheerful demeanor that he begins to tell her more and more about himself. As he does, Catarina proposes an idea...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/npvk4ftr6lISLGc6VqqcbvR4ls8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The one behind the kidnapping of Catarina Claes turns out to be someone that nobody expected. Catarina is shocked to learn the true reason why he kidnapped her, but he's so moved by her cheerful demeanor that he begins to tell her more and more about himself. As he does, Catarina proposes an idea...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/npvk4ftr6lISLGc6VqqcbvR4ls8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15604","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120209","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42282","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94904","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"371437","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"52960","synopsis":"The day after the resolution of Catarina Claes's kidnapping, the first prince, Jeffrey Stuart, passionately speaks of his love for his younger brothers to his fiancée, Susanna Randall. At the same time, Geordo and Alan are in the student council office, reminiscing about their childhood days with their older brothers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iECyIAtV1yfYozviebLVuNNMahZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"The day after the resolution of Catarina Claes's kidnapping, the first prince, Jeffrey Stuart, passionately speaks of his love for his younger brothers to his fiancée, Susanna Randall. At the same time, Geordo and Alan are in the student council office, reminiscing about their childhood days with their older brothers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iECyIAtV1yfYozviebLVuNNMahZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15604","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120209","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42282","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94904","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"371437","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"53133","synopsis":"Catarina is overwhelmed by Geordo's suddenly passionate advances. Since she had no romantic experience in her previous life, either, she has no idea what to do. When she receives an invitation to stay at the royal palace villa, she's still unable to sort out her feelings, and upon arriving there, she learns that the nearby forest is rumored to be haunted by a ghost.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fNASPwHpu84nNjdEtFrahOgbrDO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Catarina is overwhelmed by Geordo's suddenly passionate advances. Since she had no romantic experience in her previous life, either, she has no idea what to do. When she receives an invitation to stay at the royal palace villa, she's still unable to sort out her feelings, and upon arriving there, she learns that the nearby forest is rumored to be haunted by a ghost.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fNASPwHpu84nNjdEtFrahOgbrDO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumb